00:47:51.670 --> 00:47:55.230
- Well, so the
Einstein-Podolsky-Rosen paradox,

00:47:55.230 --> 00:47:58.040
this is back in the early
days of quantum physics

00:47:58.040 --> 00:48:00.320
where we were really scratching our heads.

00:48:00.320 --> 00:48:03.330
Not we, I mean, I wasn't
